  "title": "Not Your Usual Pasta Salad",
  "description": "Seashell pasta is tossed with hard-boiled eggs, bacon, Cheddar cheese, colorful vegetables and a creamy dressing. It is perfect for parties and potlucks.",
  "authors": [
    "Phyllis"
  ],
  "date_published": "2016-06-04T09:32:35-04:00",
